# The hook at every boot: TOS sets its vectors again at a reset, and the
# user firmware (the sentinel keeps CMD_START) installs the hook again in a
# block the pre-GEMDOS init has cleared and stamped again. After a warm reset
# the vectors point into the block once more and its counters start at 0.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/autotest.st
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key f
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
screen same autotest 1500
hookstate first
reset warm
newlog "Setting shared variable 1 to" 1500
wait 100
key 0x01
screen same autotest 1500
hookstate again
key 0x39
desktop 2500
